{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3420ef4c6355dcff","name":"Miraluka","source":{"id":"source:reference-3420ef4c6355dcff","title":"Miraluka","revision":26746,"timestamp":"2025-07-09T19:12:04Z","sha256":"c3b01eda8226dc515c715321397e54e0bf2887834a16f9b297b989048c9e63c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26746","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Miraluka&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3420ef4c6355dcff","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Miraluka are remarkably similar to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},", except for two important and distinctive differences. Miraluka have no eyes, but they have a natural ability to \"see\" by using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Since they appear ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},"- including their speech and mannerisms- Miraluka attempt to blend with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"}," when traveling throughout the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Thus, estimating how often they travel or how many live off their home planet of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Alpheridies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Alpheridies","referenceId":"reference:ea1abadc1aa3cbe7"}," is difficult, but the number is relativity low. To make matters worse, the Sith Lord Darth Nihilus consumed the colony of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Katarr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Katarr?action=edit&redlink=1"}," after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"},". Currently, no major centers of Miraluka life exist outside of their homeworld and colonies, though individuals might be encountered anywhere in the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It is highly unusual for an entire sapient Species to be Force-sensitive. Given their connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", it is common for Miraluka to join ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". In fact, several Miraluka became central figures in shaping the Jedi traditions after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"},". The strength of a Miraluka's connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," varies by individual. Miraluka who are not powerful enough to become full-fledged Jedi serve the Order in supporting roles. Most live lives similar to that of a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Miraluka and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"}," tend not to intermarry, given the unpredictable and often unhappy genetic results. A rare exception is Krynda, daughter of a Miraluka father and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," mother. She was born with both Force Sight and functioning ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," eyes.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Miraluka Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Miraluka are a thoughtful, cautious, and deliberate Species. They have little interest in personal gain or glory. Some have a strong desire to follow their own path, due to their connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". They remain committed once a course of action is selected.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Miraluka are similar to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},". They cover their featureless eye sockets with cloth or visors, especially when training. A typical Miraluka stands 1.8 meters tall and weighs 75 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Miraluka age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-11 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-15 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["16-44 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["45-69 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["70-84 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["85+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The terrestrial world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Alpheridies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Alpheridies","referenceId":"reference:ea1abadc1aa3cbe7"}," in the Abron System, in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Expansion Region"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Expansion_Region?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Miraluka speak Miralukese and Basic. They can read and write by \"seeing\" through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Damaya Guru, Embrul Joff, Jerec, Q'Anilia, Shoaneb Culu, Visas Marr, Zebron Tadro.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Miraluka adventurers are almost always Force-sensitive. They can be of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},", but are often ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Miraluka Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Miraluka share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Miraluka receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},". Miraluka have keen minds, but their reliance on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to perceive their surroundings prevents them from reacting as quickly as most."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Miraluka have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Miraluka have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," A Miraluka who has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Force Sight:"]}," Although blind, Miraluka can \"see\" by using ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". They act normally, without taking any penalties for blindness when in the presence of living creatures, or life of any kind. This trait enables them to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks, and read and write as a sighted person.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["They can ignore the effect of darkness as if they had ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},". Miraluka cannot, however, detect creatures that are \"invisible\" to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysalamiri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysalamiri","referenceId":"reference:76fbe6787718be60"},". These creatures have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," from Miraluka, as do creatures in areas that dampen or suppress ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Additionally, Miraluka ignore all penalties to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Cover"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},"). Miraluka do not increase the DC of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," against targets with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Cover"},"."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Miraluka can speak, read (through their Force Sight), and write (through their Force Sight) both Basic and Miralukese."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
